elopment of tourist infrastructure. This paper reviews the evidence for ecotourism's capacity to generate revenue for protected-area management and appraises the financial viability of nature tourism in the Congo Basin.","citation":"David S. Wilkie & Julia F. Carpenter (1999)","page":"1"}
